        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Abramu wakaambila Loti kuti, Wence kutabi inkondo akati kesu, yebo ambebo, abeembeli bako abeembeli bangu, nkaambo tuli bamukowa omwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.8",
